short_description:
New Claim Assignment automates the claim assignment process by assigning new claims to individual adjusters, CSRs or managers.
Allows adjusters to reject claims and escalate them to unit manager for reassignment.
Identifies possible duplicate claims;
Notifies unit managers if notifications are not acted on in a timely manner;
Allows adjusters to transfer claims other adjusters, claims offices;
Allows managers to identify staff resources and define their roles; 
Identifies claims that have subrogation potential and notifies (via e-mail) the subro unit in Atlanta;
Notify CSRs of the ?acceptance? of new claims (which causes them to assemble the claim folder and deliver it to the adjuster).
Web application runs continuously on adjusters? desktops 
Independent of ?source? NOL and claim systems
Captures inbound faxes sent to FNS

